  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NPM-Desarrollo Organizacional de FES</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project goal is to strengthen the organization of FES to improve the management of its social development projects. The objectives are to improve the capacity of FES&#x2019; leaders, to develop operational and legal documents, and to increase the number of potential donors. The target groups are the personnel and board members of FES, and all present and future participants in FES&#x2019; projects. The theme of the project is A Strong Civil Society and the geographic location is Cochabamba.</narrative>
  </description>
